<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia building approvals fall in Dec.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia building approvals fall in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian dwelling unit building approvals fell a seasonally-adjusted 1.0 percent in December to 10,836 from 10,942 in November, compared with 10,311 in December 1995, the Australian Bureau of Statistics said.</p>
<p>Economists on average had expected building approvals to rise around 1.5 percent.</p>
</text>
